You just lost 3 luck points and angered your god by 1 point.

Without a luckstone (which I assume you do not have since you are in
the very early game), the luck will revert to 0 within 3*600 turns
(3*300 with angry god, IIRC).
As for the angered god, it's a bit worse. You should consult the
spoiler http://www.nethack.de/spoiler/appeasement.txt to check which
sacrifices are worthy. If a sacrifice is not worthy you will have a
"feeling of inadequacy" and nothing will happen. Since you only
angered your god by one point, one worthy sacrifice will be enough,
but they may be a bit though for you. Also, you will need a co-aligned
altar to do that.

In any case, don't pray until you appease your god.

